  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "Pauper is still largely digesting the impact of Zeta rather than FRA. Both Dimir Faeries with [[card:Baleful Strix|Baleful Strix]] and Esper Affinity with [[card:Dispatch|Dispatch]] (plus [[card:Baleful Strix|Baleful Strix]]) are performing well.",
          "zh": "纯铁相比FRA，基本还是在继续消化Zeta带来的冲击。[[card:Baleful Strix|恶邪枭]]套牌蓝黑仙灵和[[card:Dispatch|迅速了结]]（+[[card:Baleful Strix|恶邪枭]]）套牌艾斯波共鸣表现都不错。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "mono-blue-terror",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "9da620d13e6f9e54a6ab1e76cafb78313b8536411c5c2796f8cef8abf5ed8823",
              "deck_id": "432084907928815e503c",
              "display_name": "Mono-Blue Terror",
              "event_id": "12855463",
              "final_rank": 4,
              "player": "Purgatory_01",
              "starttime": "2026-10-01 19:00:00.0"
            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Mono-Blue Terror · Purgatory_01 · Rank 4",
              "zh": "纯蓝惧兽 · Purgatory_01 · 第4名"
            },
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:432084907928815e503c"
          }
        ],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "The only new FRA card to appear in Challenge Top 8 decklists was [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]]. A [[card:Sneaky Snacker|Sneaky Snacker]] version of Mono-Blue Terror running three copies made the Top 4 this week: deck:432084907928815e503c. [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] gives mono-blue another way to discard [[card:Sneaky Snacker|Sneaky Snacker]] and bring it straight back to the battlefield. It can also be cast after being milled into the graveyard, making it a good fit for the deck.",
          "zh": "FRA新牌出现在挑战赛八强中的只有[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]，一套带了3张的贪吃灵版本纯蓝惧兽本周打进四强：deck:432084907928815e503c。[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]也是一个纯蓝可以弃掉贪吃灵并直接拉回场的组件，也是自磨进坟之后可以施放的咒语，和套牌配合不错。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
